[04/27 14:27:15     50s]   floorplan_check_types(root)
[04/27 14:27:15     50s]                         # enum* {basic fence odd_even_site_row macro_pin color alignment_following_pin
[04/27 14:27:15     50s]                         # alignment_partition_clone bus_guide_connectivity feed_through
