[04/27 14:27:15     50s]                         # from the LEF global MANUFACTURINGGRID statement. The x_origin y_origin is lower
[04/27 14:27:15     50s]                         # left corner of die box(the design .boundary). See the layer .mfg_grid values if
[04/27 14:27:15     50s]                         # the mfg_grid varies per layer.
[04/27 14:27:15     50s]   floorplan_max_io_height(root)
[04/27 14:27:15     50s]                         # bool, read/write, default=false, indices={}
