[04/27 14:27:15     50s]                         # cell_edge_type2 spacing}. The edge-type names match the base_cell's
[04/27 14:27:15     50s]                         # right_edge_type and left_edge_type attribute values.
[04/27 14:27:15     50s]   place_design_floorplan_mode(root)
